# Effect style

SSOT: [`docs/standards/effect-style.md`](../../docs/standards/effect-style.md).

- Prefer `effect` / `effect/unstable/*`; use platform/node services, not raw `node:*`.
- Isolate unavoidable Node primitives behind small Effect-returning helpers.
- Wire errors: `Data.TaggedError` / Schema — never extend native `Error`.
- Read pinned Effect source before guessing APIs.
